817
00:59:05,140 --> 00:59:14,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Mr. Chair, we have been making representations pero hindi naman kami nabibigyan ng response.

818
00:59:14,140 --> 00:59:20,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Pero continuous po ang representations namin dito since narinig namin itong sitwasyon na ito.

819
00:59:20,140 --> 00:59:25,140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Secretary, may mga casualties. Nire-report din po ba sa inyo?

820
00:59:26,140 --> 00:59:37,140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Nang both sides, like may namatay niya Filipino dito sa grupo namin o dito sa amin, sa bansa namin dahil nandun siya sa front line.

821
00:59:37,140 --> 00:59:40,140
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Do they report it to us or to our embassies?

822
00:59:40,140 --> 00:59:45,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Under the strict observance po sa Vienna Convention on Consular Notification,

823
00:59:45,140 --> 00:59:52,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: they are bound to always inform yung nationality kung may casualty.

824
00:59:52,140 --> 00:59:55,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So far naman po dito sa sitwasyon na ito, wala hukin.

825
00:59:56,140 --> 01:00:00,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: May isa lang po kami palang natanggap na…

826
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:02,520
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: casualty.

827
01:00:03,280 --> 01:00:04,140
