1004
01:10:12,740 --> 01:10:16,760
DFA Assistant Secretary Anne Jalando-on Louis: So, currently, we have, ah, established a technical working group.

1005
01:10:16,780 --> 01:10:26,400
DFA Assistant Secretary Anne Jalando-on Louis: With the Bureau of Immigration and, uh, uh, with the Office of Consular Affairs as representative in the TWG.

1006
01:10:26,620 --> 01:10:41,080
DFA Assistant Secretary Anne Jalando-on Louis: And also with, um, ah, airport authorities, uh, particularly the, uh, technical team that mans the E-Gates because it's a private company that's, uh, in charge of the E-Gates.

