01:10:41,080 --> 01:10:43,480
DFA Assistant Secretary Anne Jalando-on Louis: In order to monitor this.

1008
01:10:44,020 --> 01:10:46,640
DFA Assistant Secretary Anne Jalando-on Louis: And, uh, we have been discussing the actual,

